<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00221/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个████牌头戴式耳机，在被人用来听歌时，使用者会不自觉地唱出正在听的歌<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.pigeon的办公室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被放置于Site-██低价值异常物品收容室中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>I want something just like this～Oh, I want something just like this～</em>——正在使用项目听歌的Dr.pigeon<br />
<em>Oh,I want something just he stop！</em>——被Dr.pigeon的歌声折磨到崩溃的特工fan</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00221" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00221" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00221-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608925504" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590676061 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 May 2020 14:27</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00158/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一瓶无商标的墨水瓶，瓶身标签上有“可回收”字样。其内含墨水不溶于水或有机溶剂。其墨迹会在一定温度下“融化”并恢复液态。将其收集并冷却后重新倾倒于纸面上可以恢复先前字迹。已经写下的字迹无法被还原。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>苏博士的办公桌<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被记录，同时仍由苏博士保管<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>这瓶墨水已经不能用了。无论是用钢笔写，还是直接泼洒，都只会显示出已经写好的文字，一部断断续续的、用陌生人的笔迹写的蹩脚小说——它是液态的文字，而不是什么墨水。另外，我还想举报一下我的后勤。</em>——苏博士</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00158" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00158" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00158-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/falconiformes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5842934); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5842934&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608925504" alt="Falconiformes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5842934)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/falconiformes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5842934); return false;">Falconiformes</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588765669 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">06 May 2020 11:47</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00425/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一瓶<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">30</span>27粒由███公司生产的██-III型强效致幻剂，其异常在于会使服用者保持极度清醒状态长达数小时。在此期间，服用者的疼痛耐性，精神抗性以及思维等方面都会得到极大程度的提升。目前未发现任何副作用。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>某药店。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Area-CN-15生物工程部门制药分部的冷藏单元内。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>建议复制并下放到机动特遣队。-Dr.K</em><br />
<em>如试验期间未发现明显副作用可以考虑为特遣队配备。-鱼骨</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00425" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00425" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00425-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6606914&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608925504" alt="kaster-k" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6606914)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;">kaster-k</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1601730668 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">03 Oct 2020 13:11</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00435/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个蓝色四指环型握力器，其上用白色油漆印有“劣质产品® ”字样，当有人员把四根手指都伸入指环时，指环的半径将缩小10~26%，该异常影响通常持续时间从5分钟到█小时不等，期间该物品无法被以任何方式破坏<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/10/5<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-82训练区域健身区C2号器材架<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>于Site-CN-82异常物品仓库中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>“喂喂喂你这样是拔不出来的！”——Dr.Gaster，选自事故记录-H0714</em><br />
<em>“哼！啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！”Dr.Cerberus，选自事故记录-H0714</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00435" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00435" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00435-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gaster-master" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3398699); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3398699&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608925504" alt="Gaster Master" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3398699)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gaster-master" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3398699); return false;">Gaster Master</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602080060 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">07 Oct 2020 14:14</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00136/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把FK-1战术刀，该战术刀在材质上无任何异常，但无法对任何生物造成任何损伤，不过可以轻易割开无机物和死去的生物。对匕首的硬度实验表明其硬度与金刚石相当。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>浙江省衢州市发生的绑架案中回收<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于Site-CN-██的食堂中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>当我发现歹徒用匕首在人质脖子上划了好几刀都没造成任何伤口时，我就知道这刀肯定有问题。——特工.Monday<br />
这简直就是厨房神器！我爱死它了，就是容易切坏菜板。——Site-CN-██的厨师长</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00136" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00136" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00136-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-monday" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6383966); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6383966&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608925504" alt="Agent-Monday" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6383966)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-monday" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6383966); return false;">Agent-Monday</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588255383 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">30 Apr 2020 14:03</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00113/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台███牌的电冰箱，在打开时会将周围的室温升高至5█℃。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>201█/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-82员工食堂<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>Site-CN-82中价值物品仓库。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>申请开设桑拿房。</em>-刚刚检查仓库回来的Dr.Leo<br />
<em>原因？</em>-Site-CN-82站点主管██████<br />
<em>这不仅关系到异常物品的保存，而且关系到我们站点的电费——您能够想象一打开仓库有半个仓库的研究员在用这玩意撒上水蒸桑拿吗？</em>-被一堆研究员拿着记忆删除喷雾追了半个站点的Dr.Leo<br />
<em>拒······批准。</em>-Site-CN-82站点主管██████<br />
-</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00113" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00113" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00113-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6158338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608925504" alt="LEEEEEEOOOOOO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6158338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;">LEEEEEEOOOOOO</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587818740 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">25 Apr 2020 12:45</span></p>
</div>
